msgctxt "t3d1a186b13"
msgid "Je pense que je pourrais continuer encore longtemps a vrai dire."
msgstr "Para falar a verdade, eu acho que conseguiria continuar por muito tempo."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "event_noriko_doggy_1e409be2"
msgid "Stop... Je ... J'en peut plus !"
msgstr "Para... Eu... Eu não aguento mais!"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "event_noriko_doggy_7df45f8f"
msgid "Ma parole tu es infatigable !"
msgstr "Pelo amor de Deus, você é incansável!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "event_noriko_doggy_497e82a2"
msgid "Désolé..."
msgstr "Desculpe..."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "event_noriko_doggy_a598094c"
msgid "Maman va bientôt rentrer et demain nous devons nous occuper du dernier de ces trois abrutis."
msgstr "Minha mãe já vai chegar e amanhã temos que cuidar do último daqueles três idiotas."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "event_noriko_doggy_3e85771d"
msgid "Oui..."
msgstr "Sim..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "event_noriko_doggy_bb7a660f"
msgid "[font_size=14]Mes chéris ! Je suis rentrée ![/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=14]Meus amores! Cheguei![/font_size]"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "event_noriko_doggy_7f221708"
msgid "Zut ! Occupe toi d'elle pendant que je rentre dans ma chambre !"
msgstr "Droga! Distrai ela enquanto eu corro pro meu quarto!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`guilty`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "event_noriko_doggy_0d39eedd"
msgid "Mais je suis complètement nue !"
msgstr "Mas eu estou completamente pelado!"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "event_noriko_doggy_a8c01f2f"
msgid "Improvise !"
msgstr "Improvisa!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "event_noriko_doggy_e9bd6bd0"
msgid "Facile a dire..."
msgstr "Fácil falar..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "event_noriko_doggy_f7afcd1d"
msgid "Allez {{saito.n}} tu peux le faire, tu as deja connu des situations plus critiques que ça !"
msgstr "Vamos lá, {{saito.n}}, você consegue. Você já passou por situações muito piores que essa!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_452f8d5c"
msgid "Cela faisait un certain temps que nous ne nous étions pas retrouvés seuls rien que toi et moi..."
msgstr "Fazia um tempo que não ficávamos sozinhos, só você e eu..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_60fa72e3"
msgid "Tu m'as manqué tu sais..."
msgstr "Senti sua falta, sabe..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_47687564"
msgid "\"Ca\" m'a manquée."
msgstr "Senti falta \"disso\"."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_3eadf778"
msgid "Tu m'as manquée aussi mais je suis un peu f-"
msgstr "Eu também senti, mas estou um pouco cansa-"

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_dd93b3f4"
msgid "Ne t'inquiète pas... Nous ne sommes pas obligés de faire des folies."
msgstr "Não se preocupe... Não precisamos fazer nenhuma loucura."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_245458f4"
msgid "Nous pouvons aussi faire ça tendrement."
msgstr "Podemos fazer algo mais suave hoje."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_9156b917"
msgid "Je..."
msgstr "Eu..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_fbd34660"
msgid "Allez viens !"
msgstr "Vem logo!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_aaa9f4fd"
msgid "d'accord..."
msgstr "Tudo bem..."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_b0f8d7e3"
msgid "Et bien {{noriko.n}}, j'espère que tu as pu réussir a sortir de la chambre sinon..."
msgstr "Bom, {{noriko.n}}, espero que você tenha conseguido sair do quarto, senão..."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_90dc4bec"
msgid "Tu risques de passer un moment bien malaisant..."
msgstr "Você corre o risco de passar por um momento bem constrangedor..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t78db667372"
msgid "Tu semblais étrange, quelque chose ne va pas ?"
msgstr "Você está meio estranho, tem algo errado?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t214c929c88"
msgid "Non, non, tout va bien."
msgstr "Não, não, está tudo bem."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "te204b19f32"
msgid "Je le sais quand tu me caches des choses..."
msgstr "Eu percebo quando você está escondendo algo de mim..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "tc79df12ff2"
msgid "Regarde-moi bien dans les yeux et laisse-moi t'aider à oublier tes problèmes."
msgstr "Olhe bem nos meus olhos e deixe eu te ajudar a esquecer os seus problemas."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "tc6faa8eda8"
msgid "Oui... Pardon, je ne peux décidément rien te cacher."
msgstr "Sim... Desculpe, eu realmente não consigo esconder nada de você."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t3134935fa8"
msgid "Allez viens là !"
msgstr "Vem cá!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "te7c15a9046"
msgid "Hmm voilà comme ça !"
msgstr "Hmm... isso, assim!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t9c8b2fb57f"
msgid "Juste toi et moi."
msgstr "Só você e eu."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "tbc38954e8f"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "tcd45d29baa"
msgid "Continue mon chéri !"
msgstr "Continua, querido!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t7f720676ac"
msgid "Ce soir tu m'appartiens."
msgstr "Esta noite você me pertence."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t691130f681"
msgid "et je suis aussi tout à toi."
msgstr "E eu também sou toda sua."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t9a06ecb448"
msgid "Oh mon dieu, Oui !"
msgstr "Oh meu Deus, sim!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t0219c71d3e"
msgid "Je vais jouir !"
msgstr "Eu vou gozar!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "tf28683a90d"
msgid "Jouis avec moi."
msgstr "Goza comigo!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "taf6c5a0274"
msgid "Ahh... Ouiii!"
msgstr "Ahh... Siiim!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_51660c14"
msgid "Elle a fini par s'endormir..."
msgstr "Ela acabou dormindo..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_228305a3"
msgid "Bon sang quelle soirée."
msgstr "Caramba, que noite."

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`angry`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_d6a6c8c6"
msgid "[font_size=14]Bordel pourquoi il a fallu que tu fasses ça avec ma mere juste sous mon nez !![/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=14]Puta merda, por que você teve que fazer isso com a minha mãe na minha frente?![/font_size]"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_2c33ae4a"
msgid "[font_size=14]Désolé... Je n'ai pas pu lui dire non, je pensais que tu avais réussi a sortir.[/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=14]Desculpa... Eu não consegui dizer não, eu achei que você tivesse conseguido sair.[/font_size]"

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`shame`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_8e197ac3"
msgid "[font_size=14]Et comment j'aurais pu faire ? Vous étiez tous les deux dans le salon ![/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=14]E como eu ia fazer isso? Vocês dois estavam bem no meu caminho![/font_size]"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_bf56975f"
msgid "[font_size=14]Et puis comment ça se fait que tu aies pu enchaîner avec elle après tout ce qu'on a fait toi et moi ?[/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=14]E como você conseguiu continuar com ela depois de tudo o que a gente fez?[/font_size]"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_bb829b7c"
msgid "[font_size=14]C'est peut être pas le meilleur moment pour discuter de ça...[/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=14]Talvez esse não seja o melhor momento para discutir isso...[/font_size]"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_fa9e5d57"
msgid "[font_size=14]...[/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=14] ... [/font_size]"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t262844bbf6"
msgid "et bien... Ca a l'air assez grave."
msgstr "Bem... isso parece ser bem sério."

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t827064d1fa"
msgid "En effet."
msgstr "Com certeza."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t45f43b7d2a"
msgid "Tu as une idée pour lui faire retrouver le sourire ?"
msgstr "Você tem alguma ideia para fazer ela voltar a sorrir?"

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`moved`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t3c19c8622e"
msgid "Tout ça m'a fait repenser à nous."
msgstr "Tudo isso me fez pensar na gente."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`surprised`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t710909f630"
msgid "A nous ? Comment ça ?"
msgstr "Na gente? Como assim?"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "tf23b23d2fe"
msgid "Tu n'as pas idée à quel point j'étais heureuse d'être enfin considérée comme une femme après tout ce temps."
msgstr "Você não tem ideia de como fiquei feliz por finalmente ser tratada como mulher depois de tanto tempo."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "tbcfca6d888"
msgid "Redécouvrir le plaisir d'aimer et d'être aimé en retour."
msgstr "Redescobrir o prazer de amar e ser amada."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "td2e615574d"
msgid "Tu m'as comblée de bonheur quand tu t'es occupé de moi, tout ça m'a donné une idée."
msgstr "Você me encheu de felicidade quando cuidou de mim, e tudo isso me deu uma ideia."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "TU_N_AS_PAS_ID_E_QUEL_POINT_J_13A6F3"
msgid "Tu n'as pas idée à quel point j'étais heureuse d'être enfin soutenue après tout ce temps à lutter seule."
msgstr "Você não faz ideia de como eu fiquei feliz por ter alguém do meu lado depois de tanto tempo lutando sozinha."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "AVOIR_UNE_PAULE_SUR_LAQUELLE_S_58C7B8"
msgid "Avoir une épaule sur laquelle s'appuyer."
msgstr "Ter um ombro onde me apoiar."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "TOUT_A_M_A_COMBL_E_DE_BONHEUR_A059C6"
msgid "Tout ça m'a comblée de bonheur et ça me donne une idée..."
msgstr "Tudo isso me encheu de felicidade e me deu uma ideia..."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`guilty`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t841c1f176c"
msgid "Je ne suis pas sûr de savoir où tu veux en venir."
msgstr "Não tenho certeza se sei onde você quer chegar."

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t8e1e247912"
msgid "J'aimerais que {{sayuri.n}} puisse connaitre ce même bonheur."
msgstr "Eu queria que a {{sayuri.n}} pudesse conhecer essa mesma felicidade."

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t6cc7eb957c"
msgid "Sinon j'ai peur qu'elle fasse des bêtises qu'elle pourrait regretter."
msgstr "Senão, tenho medo que ela faça alguma bobagem da qual possa se arrepender."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t2e069a817d"
msgid "Et bien présenté de cette façon c'est difficile de refuser."
msgstr "Bem, apresentado dessa forma, fica difícil recusar."

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`surprised`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t842201da64"
msgid "Quel est le problème ? Tu ne l'apprécies pas ?"
msgstr "Qual é o problema? Você não gosta dela?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t4879fc7ac8"
msgid "Non, non, rien a voir."
msgstr "Não, não, nada a ver."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`guilty`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t3cae13c655"
msgid "C'est une femme gentille et très attachante mais... Tu ne vas pas être... Jalouse si je passe plus de temps avec elle qu'avec toi ?"
msgstr "Ela é uma mulher gentil e muito cativante, mas... você não vai ficar... com ciúmes se eu passar mais tempo com ela do que com você?"

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`moved`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t870aa99030"
msgid "Mon chéri, c'est adorable que tu penses à moi avant tout mais ne t'en fais pas, il ne s'agit que de quelques jours le temps que sa fille ne revienne."
msgstr "Meu amor, é adorável que você pense em mim primeiro, mas não se preocupe, seriam só alguns dias, até que a filha dela volte."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t634d5683c6"
msgid "Autre problème que je vois.... {{sayuri.n}} acceptera t'elle de passer du temps avec un homme qui à l'âge de sa fille."
msgstr "E tem mais outro problema... a {{sayuri.n}} vai aceitar passar tempo com um homem que tem a idade da filha dela?"

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t670df50b98"
msgid "Ne t'inquiète pas, je sais de source sûre qu'elle n'est pas insensible à tes charmes."
msgstr "Não se preocupe, eu sei de fonte segura que ela não é indiferente aos seus encantos."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`surprised`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "tfb2f7a06d7"
msgid "Une seconde, ça veut dire quoi ça...?"
msgstr "Espera aí, o que isso quer dizer...?"

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t1fac59ba5f"
msgid "Allez viens avec moi !"
msgstr "Vem comigo!"

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`shame`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "MAMAN_POURQUOI_SAITO_N_N_EST_T_28B170"
msgid "Maman... Pourquoi {{saito.n}} n'est toujours pas rentré ?"
msgstr ""

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "TU_T_INQUI_TES_POUR_LUI_6574ED"
msgid "Tu t'inquiètes pour lui ?"
msgstr ""

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "NON_C_EST_JUSTE_QUE_IL_EST_DI_B5AD20"
msgid "... Non... c'est juste que... il est... différent..."
msgstr ""

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`surprised`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "AH_JE_NE_SUIS_DONC_PAS_LA_SEUL_47EFB7"
msgid "Ah ! Je ne suis donc pas la seule à l'avoir remarqué."
msgstr ""

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`neutral`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "QUELQUE_CHOSE_A_CHANG_DANS_SON_1E385F"
msgid "Quelque chose a changé dans son regard, il est plus vif qu'auparavant."
msgstr ""

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`afraid`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "A_NE_R_POND_TOUJOURS_PAS_MA_Q_D2BA58"
msgid "Ça ne répond toujours pas à ma question... Et s'il avait eu un problème ?"
msgstr ""

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "JE_CROIS_QUE_NOTRE_SAITO_N_FAI_75A64A"
msgid "Je crois que notre {{saito.n}} fait tout simplement de son mieux."
msgstr ""

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "NOUS_DEVONS_LUI_FAIRE_CONFIANC_CE9A3A"
msgid "Nous devons lui faire confiance, il est adulte et capable de prendre ses propres décisions."
msgstr ""

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
