msgstr "Porra... Vai devagar, já estou até sem fôlego."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_natsume_natsume_room.dialogue
msgctxt "ON_VIENT_A_PEINE_DE_COMMENCER_3620C3"
msgid "On vient à peine de commencer!"
msgstr "A gente mal começou!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_natsume_natsume_room.dialogue
msgctxt "CA_FAIT_PLUSIEURS_JOURS_QUE_TU_E6A579"
